 - `DesktopNovelAiSmokeStore` retains smoke outputs and exact launch recipes in the Desktop-only `desktop_phase7_novelai_smoke` singleton for later local reuse; it is not Studio history authority. The accepted automated live evidence uses one request; additional automated real generation is frozen pending explicit user authorization.
 
 ## Desktop Studio and image runtime (P7-C)
+
+- Chat screenshots use `DesktopChatScreenshotHost` for immutable message/version/voice snapshots and the User-context selection tree over official block IDs. `DesktopScreenshotWindow` uses Compose `SwingDialog` with the exact parent already published by Main (`LocalDesktopFishParentWindow`); its close callback belongs only to the workspace. `DesktopScreenshotPreview` keeps numeric dual-axis extents/zoom on a viewport-sized canvas; preview zoom never resizes the export raster. `DesktopChatScreenshotRenderer` retains PNG budgets/owned reads, captures resource hashes, and `saveDesktopScreenshotVerified` reproves messages/resources after the picker before no-overwrite export. Focused entries: `DesktopScreenshotWorkspaceTest`, `DesktopScreenshotWorkspaceUiTest`, `DesktopChatScreenshotTest`, `DesktopChatScreenshotUiTest`. Offscreen shell injection does not verify native HWND routing or root-lock lifetime.
+
 - Presentation closure uses `DesktopStudioControls` for chips, bounded anchored enum menus, precise sliders, switches, collapsible advanced settings and the isolated custom-size editor. `SearchableChoice` uses a search window only above 12 items. These controls publish through existing Studio draft callbacks; they do not own model/sampler capability or request policy.
 - `DesktopStudioPromptField` keeps one `StudioPromptTextEditor` for inline/fullscreen sessions. Shared parser/translation offsets are matched against exact current text before glyph-aligned ruby painting; query-tagged suggestions retain shared ranking and reject stale catalog versions. Annotations never enter the raw text. `DesktopChatAttachmentAction` sits beside fullscreen/send in the composer action rail. The 112dp pending strip has preview and hover removal and is absent when empty. Automatic-image/background controls live in Session Settings → 图片; background writes remain immediate while the shared session draft survives tab changes.
 
